# A second variant of the water: the troughs and the crests moved by other amounts again.
fork water water_c
variant of=water
layer main
shift 17,13 wrap
layer crest
frame 1
shift 14,3 wrap
frame 2
shift 14,3 wrap
frame 3
shift 14,3 wrap
frame 4
shift 14,3 wrap
layer glint
frame 1
shift 14,3 wrap
frame 2
shift 14,3 wrap
frame 3
shift 14,3 wrap
frame 4
shift 14,3 wrap
frame 1
layer main
